<tr><td bgcolor="#11154A" style="padding:27px 25px;background-color:#11154A;background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#553FBA,#2F5582,#11154A)"><div style="font:800 21px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">AI・行銷情報</div><div style="font:11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D6D4E8;padding-top:4px">AI MARKETING DAILY · HK / CN</div><div style="font:700 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66;padding-top:23px">MORNING BRIEF · 2026年10月27日 · 星期二</div><div style="font:800 28px/1.35 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:white;padding-top:11px">少一點 AI 噪音。<span style="color:#D3FE66">多一點行銷訊號。</span></div><div style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#EDEBF6;padding-top:14px">10 則新聞 · 精選 6 則 · 約 3 分鐘閱讀</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:25px 25px 13px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TODAY'S BIG PICTURE / 今日核心訊號</div><div style="font:800 19px/1.5 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:9px">10月27日重點：Google搜尋廣告 AI 評價摘要適用範圍、Pinterest 程序化採購新渠道，以及 Stagwell 收購 Freestar。平台開放程度與商業效益仍須按來源分辨。</div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:6px">10月27日編輯二次核實：原文發布日期、適用市場及廠商聲稱均按來源保留限制；內容無獨立實測成效保證。</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:13px 25px 7px"><div style="font:800 23px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114">今日 6 大重點</div><div style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#656A73;padding-top:3px">TOP KEY HIGHLIGHTS · 依行銷相關度排序</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">01 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#google-documents-generated-review-summaries-85edd1" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Google搜尋廣告加入AI評價摘要；目前只支援四個英語市場</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Google新說明文件確認，Search廣告可出現由網上評價生成的AI摘要，適用美國、澳洲、英國及印度的英語搜尋；相關功能並非香港市場全面開放。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">廣告內容開始納入由平台自動生成的第三方評價重點，品牌需要同時留意評論管理、廣告審核及不同市場的功能限制。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#google-documents-generated-review-summaries-85edd1" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">02 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#pinterest-opens-selected-programmatic-inventory-c8babf" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Pinterest於指定市場開放程序化廣告採購，亞太透過Google Ad Manager接入</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Pinterest於10月26日宣布Programmatic Deals在指定市場正式開放，企業廣告主可透過合作DSP採購部分展示及影片廣告庫存。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">媒體團隊可研究Pinterest由社交平台採購走向既有程序化工作流的機會，尤其是美容、生活方式及購物探索場景。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#pinterest-opens-selected-programmatic-inventory-c8babf" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">03 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#bloomreach-makes-external-segments-available-784b42" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Bloomreach開放External Segments，支援外部客群接入行銷觸達</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Bloomreach於10月26日宣布External Segments功能可用，讓外部數據倉庫、CDP或reverse ETL建立的客群透過API接入行銷平台。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">品牌若已在自家數據平台建立客群，可研究減少重複建立分群邏輯的可能性，同時需要核對資料流與授權。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#bloomreach-makes-external-segments-available-784b42" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">04 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#google-dv360-v5-enters-public-c0d953" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Google DV360 API v5進入公開測試，新增YouTube排除控制及DOOH訂單支援</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">使用DV360 API自動化投放或報表的代理商應先評估版本遷移對排除名單、受眾管理及DOOH流程的影響。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#google-dv360-v5-enters-public-c0d953" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #9A3A9E;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#9A3A9E">05 / 行業影響 &amp; 品牌案例 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#stagwell-acquires-freestar-expand-publisher-5f7028" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Stagwell收購Freestar，進一步整合出版商程序化廣告供應鏈</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">代理商與媒體供應商的邊界持續改變，品牌值得留意庫存透明度、供應路徑與採購利益衝突管理。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#stagwell-acquires-freestar-expand-publisher-5f7028" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #9A3A9E;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#9A3A9E">06 / 行業影響 &amp; 品牌案例 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#taobao-doubles-physical-advertising-spend-887f26" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">淘寶新加坡雙十一加碼線下廣告，強調購物探索而非只講價格</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">跨境電商平台正嘗試以品牌故事、地鐵及戶外媒體建立非促銷期間的購物需求，值得研究線上線下整合。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#taobao-doubles-physical-advertising-spend-887f26" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:23px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="background:#EBE8FF"><tr><td style="border-left:4px solid #5A42F4;padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TEAM ACTION BOARD</div><div style="font:800 18px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding:7px 0 12px">今日可以跟進嘅方向</div><table role="presentation"><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">01</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">先核對各帳戶及市場資格，檢視公開評價品質及品牌風險；不要將功能當成可手動控制的廣告附加素材。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">02</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">向Pinterest或DSP代表確認香港及目標市場可用性、庫存、衡量方式與交易條件，先做小規模測試。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">03</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">由資料及CRM團隊核對API流程、授權、同意管理與數據回傳，再決定是否試行。</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 25px"><table role="presentation"><tr><td bgcolor="#5A42F4" style="background:#5A42F4;border-radius:24px;padding:13px 25px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=cta" style="font:800 14px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:white;text-decoration:none">閱讀今日完整新聞 &#8594;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#151841" style="background:#151841;padding:24px"><div style="font:800 16px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">AI Marketing Daily</div><div style="font:12px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#E5E2EF;padding-top:8px">Curated by Carrie Hui · AI Marketing Intelligence</div><div style="font:11px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#B9BADA;padding-top:9px">本電郵為已發佈網站內容精選，原始來源請查閱網站。</div><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-27&amp;utm_content=footer" style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">在瀏覽器閱讀</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>]]></description></item></channel></rss>